WEBVTT

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:06.860
-And that's what happened.
-Thank you.

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:11.070
So Masaru really came here.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.660
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.700
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:21.910
And the gears turn

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:35.090
When the horn blows, the flames dance

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:38.060
The story waits for no-one

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.930
Off they go, the gears are churning

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:44.270
A red past chases after you

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:46.610
The jester's smile

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:49.440
What's behind the mask?

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:52.320
You can't erase the scars

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:55.030
No matter how they burn

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.030
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:01.000
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:06.710
Alone in the depths of the night

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:10.960
Let out a cry that can cut through fate

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:13.510
That's the cue to begin

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:16.840
The curtain is rising, it's time to dance

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.180
Everybody sheds tears at the end

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:24.140
So hold them in now and keep going

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:28.900
Until the day the curtain falls

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:34.240
The gears will keep turning

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:45.290
#17 Visitors

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:48.380
Sadayoshi.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.670
How much of the memory
did you see?

00:01:55.970 --> 00:01:57.970
The memory...

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:02.010
Oh, I was watching Grandpa's memory,
wasn't I?

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:07.400
I saw you marry Angelina.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:11.980
So that means you and her
had a son named Sadayoshi.

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:16.740
My dad, who you say is inside my brain.

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:19.450
Of course, Master Sadayoshi!

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:22.030
You stay quiet!

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:26.210
You still continue to act innocent,
do you?

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:30.540
You never were my son to begin with.

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:33.000
You mean...

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:36.380
My only child is Éléonore.

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:39.010
My daughter.

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:42.140
Éléonore?

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:43.350
Shirogane?

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:46.270
Don't act like you don't know!

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:52.940
Just as you saw, Angelina and I promised
to spend eternity together.

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:59.610
We studied Arlequin's workings,
then created our own marionettes.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:01.030
"...ANGELINA SAIGA"

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:02.580
It's done.

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:06.040
Good, this will protect it.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.960
I'm sorry, this is all I can do.

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:14.170
Nonsense. These words will bring strength
to these puppets.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:18.220
They will be useful for shiroganes
all over the world.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:26.220
That's when you appeared.

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:29.480
Dean!

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:35.940
Hello!

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:41.450
Monsieur Shoji,
thank you for making Angelina happy.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:44.490
Oh Angelina, I see you're doing great.

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:47.120
Oh dear, stop it now.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:51.540
Forgive me, I couldn't hold back my joy.

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:54.290
What a funny guy.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:55.550
Just like always.

00:03:56.590 --> 00:04:01.970
I was sent by Madame Lucille to help make
and transport the marionettes.

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.430
I'm the shirogane, Dean Maistre.

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:09.270
That was how I met you.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.810
In time I started my own company.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.730
And adopted you as my son.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:19.280
You changed your name
from Dean to Sadayoshi.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:24.030
I was at the height of my happiness.

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:27.240
Um, dear?

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:31.660
-I don't know how to tell you this...
-What is it?

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:36.000
I think, that for a shirogane woman...

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:39.420
This is the first case ever.

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:41.090
What is it?

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:44.470
A baby...

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:45.850
I'm pregnant.

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:48.810
A baby...

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:53.060
That's wonderful, Angelina!

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:57.020
Wow, I'm going to be a father!

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:03.570
I was in seventh heaven.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:08.580
I'd never even imagined that
I'd be able to hold my own child.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:11.290
And that was Shirogane?

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:12.330
Excuse me.

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:14.960
A strange foreigner is here.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.710
A foreigner? Must be...

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:20.090
Guy!

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:24.090
I thought so.
Have you come to kill Sadayoshi?

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:28.970
Yes, because I promised you
3 years ago.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:34.690
That I'd kill this boy if we found out
Sadayoshi had downloaded himself.

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:36.100
Thanks for coming.

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:40.400
Sadayoshi disappeared after that fight.

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:44.110
So we never knew
if the download was a success.

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:47.620
That's why you let Masaru wander around
on his own.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:53.410
If I let Masaru go to the mansion,
the Kurogas would take action.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:56.790
I figured that you would be able
to judge him then.

00:05:57.170 --> 00:06:01.130
Yes, but you came a bit early.

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:04.050
What's going on?

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:06.880
Kill me? I don't understand.

00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:12.680
I've come here before
in what you call the Meiji era.

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:14.600
On a certain mission.

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:15.810
You did?

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.650
I'll tell it to you, Sadayoshi.

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:24.740
Once you hear it all, will you still
be able to say that you're Masaru?

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:33.700
I was 12 when I contracted
ZONAPHA syndrome.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:37.500
The doctors back then
could do nothing either.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.670
And my mother left me.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.590
Under the pretense of hospitalization.

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:48.260
She was a fool.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:53.760
She gave her child candy
to try to erase her guilt.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:59.150
I'd get seizures
in the small cold hospital room.

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:01.020
But the doctors could do nothing.

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:04.190
My mother never came to see me.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:08.030
I realized amidst my pain.

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:13.330
That I'd been alone all my life.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:19.290
And then, Lucille showed me the path
to become a shirogane.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:24.040
After 10 years of training,
I had my first job.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.550
To go see Angelina.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:35.810
She lived in a village known for
its ancient puppet dances.

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:37.520
Kuroga Village.

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:42.900
It had long-standing links
with Shoji, the puppet maker.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:51.320
You must be a shirogane!
You're French, aren't you?

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:56.330
Oh, how wonderful. I haven't met
another French person for so long.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:08:00.870
I have come from Quiberon
to carry out certain orders.

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:06.250
The soft stone that creates Aqua Vitae
is vital for creating shiroganes.

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:11.260
Right now, there are not enough of us
compared to the automata.

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:16.850
We must turn as many ZONAPHA patients
as we can into shiroganes.

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.100
So...

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:24.900
I will take out the soft stone inside you
and implant it in your child.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.480
Then take it to Quiberon.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:31.860
Headquarters will extract the soft stone
from the child whenever necessary.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:41.040
You mean to make my baby
a mere vessel for the soft stone?

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:44.000
Headquarters have decided.

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:49.920
I have studied medicine.
I can do the necessary operation.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:55.390
I understand.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.010
Please wait out back.

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:04.270
What's the meaning of this?

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:07.650
I'd often asked myself.

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.110
Are shiroganes human?

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:15.660
Or are they just machines
for destroying automata?

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.620
Shiroganes are not human.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.290
You're a shirogane, too.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:24.670
No.

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.170
I am a mother.

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:31.590
What can you do with that huge belly?

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:37.140
I will never make my child
live the life I did.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.310
I'll finish this right now.

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:50.610
Shiroganes don't die,
so I won't hold back.

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:56.360
I'll immobilize you, and then
take out the soft stone.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:09:59.660
My baby...!

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.460
You thought that would help any?

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:25.980
She held her belly
and fell from her head!

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:28.730
So is that what you call motherly love?

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:30.900
Have you...

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.610
no mother...?

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:36.110
Doing such a thing...

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:38.910
What will your mother think?

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:41.410
I have no mother!

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:45.370
That woman left me. I'm all alone.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:53.500
Then you wish to make this child
live the way you did?

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:57.050
All alone, without a mother?

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:02.680
So what?

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.270
It hurts, Maman...

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:08.060
I'm so lonely, Maman...

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:10.480
Don't go!

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:14.780
Don't leave me all alone!

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:20.780
I got used to it.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:25.080
And so will that child!

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:30.580
You cannot win.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:36.460
Olympia and all the other puppets.
My husband and I made them.

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:40.340
They're not tools to take babies
away from their mothers.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:44.300
Dammit!

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:52.900
As long as I have Arlequin...

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:55.940
No, even if it's me alone.

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:58.990
I won't let you implant
the stone in my child!

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:05.490
You think you've already won?

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:07.910
Embrace of the Holy Mother!

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:11.540
I'll suck your blood out!

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.800
Arlequin won't make it...

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:21.880
"...ANGELINA SAIGA"

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:25.390
It stopped?

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:44.030
What happened then?

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:49.620
She cared for me wholeheartedly,
even though I'd come for her baby.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:51.790
Not only that...

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:56.500
Then why don't I be your mother?

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:03.340
Are you crazy?

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:07.760
I'm already embracing the life of one.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:11.890
I could always embrace another.

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:15.100
You... Shut up!

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:17.940
I hadn't given up.

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:22.740
I could take her baby
after she gave birth.

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:27.530
I waited for my health to return. Yet...

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.790
Hey, one piece each.

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:32.200
Hey, you took two!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:35.040
You'll run out of candy if you do that.

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:40.550
I just... don't need them anymore.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:46.180
And the day drew near.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.680
What day?

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.930
It's in your memory, too.

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:55.020
Yes, right around
when Guy was targeting Angelina,

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:58.730
I had an unexpected encounter.

00:13:58.900 --> 00:13:59.730
Unexpected?

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:02.650
See for yourself.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:05.070
Through my memory.

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:11.740
This again...

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:18.790
I'm running.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.420
Through a crowd.

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:24.420
Because I saw Angelina.

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:28.180
Angelina? That can't be.

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:30.890
She's in Kuroga Village right now.

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:33.930
But that must be her.

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:48.570
Why do you put a suffering person
on display?

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:51.780
Are you asking me?

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:57.290
Do people learn to laugh
by looking at this immobile doll?

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:02.500
Impossible. She looks just like Angelina.

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:04.300
But it's not her.

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:08.010
No, we don't laugh at it.

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:10.050
Rather, it's the opposite.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:15.430
This man bore the sins of all mankind
and was put up on a cross.

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:18.770
Sins? What is a sin?

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:22.110
To kill people, to be greedy.

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:24.980
Oh yes, there's an interesting one.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:28.650
To make an image
of anything in this world.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:32.530
An image?

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.910
So puppets are a sin, too?

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:41.500
Well, I've built my fortune
by making puppets.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.670
That'd make me quite a sinner.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:45.630
A puppet maker?

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:48.220
Then do you know...

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:51.430
A human named Angelina Saiga?

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:54.970
Who the hell are you?

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:56.720
I hear gears turning.

00:15:57.270 --> 00:15:58.680
Are you...?

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:02.480
I have come here to meet that woman.

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:06.230
I'm the Francine automaton.

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:11.320
What? So you're the leader
of the Midnight Circus.

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.120
What do you want with my wife?

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:22.120
I came to ask Angelina Saiga
to dismantle my body.

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:29.380
-Are you sure about this?
-Yes.

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:34.260
Then I will first adjust you
to be weaker than a human.

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:42.140
Wow, the person who created you
was quite the technician.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:49.110
Yes, but my creator
wouldn't take me with him.

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:54.740
Goodbye, you thing that isn't Francine.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.660
Goodbye...

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:00.370
Creator...

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:08.670
If you do not like me
because I cannot laugh...

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:12.920
I will learn how to laugh.

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:18.010
So please do not leave me.

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:22.230
Please, do not leave me...

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:27.690
-And so you left on a journey.
-Yes.

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:31.740
A long journey with my friends.

00:17:32.740 --> 00:17:37.490
But even after 100 years,
I couldn't understand how to laugh.

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:40.830
I became weary.

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:44.080
So I chose to be gone.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:49.710
I found a name on a shirogane's marionette
that I had once destroyed.

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.920
That name gave me hope.

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:59.850
I decided to let the Francine doll
meet Angelina.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:06.730
I figured she should be judged by someone
who had suffered from ZONAPHA.

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:11.730
Of course, I let Angelina know beforehand
through a letter.

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:18.070
But was this puppet really evil?

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:20.280
I was beginning to have doubts.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:28.000
She really does look like me.

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:31.460
Just like Lucille, my mother, told me.

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:33.130
What do you mean?

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:35.630
My mother had an aunt.

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:39.470
But there was a famine in the village.

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:44.520
And the aunt was sent far away
for one less mouth to feed.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:49.230
Her name was Francine.

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:52.770
I see. No wonder you look so alike.

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:54.650
A pleasure to meet you.

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:56.320
-I am...
-Francine!

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:58.200
Why are you...

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:00.820
Guy Christophe will destroy you!

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:04.620
Wait, I wish to ask her something first!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:07.710
What's wrong?

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:10.580
The baby...

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:16.340
The contractions are strong.
Not too long now.

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:17.760
Hang in there.

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:22.760
I'm fine,
and I'm glad you're here with me.

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:26.930
It'll take half a day to fetch a midwife.

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:31.020
-Guy...
-Huh?

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:33.230
Will you do it?

00:19:34.070 --> 00:19:34.900
Me?

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:38.740
You told me you studied medicine.

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:41.570
I tried to take your baby away, remember?

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:47.250
Please, I want you to do it.

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:51.330
She wishes it. And so do I.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:58.840
Okay, fine!

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:01.380
Bring some warm water!

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:07.930
What is Angelina doing?

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:09.430
Is she sick?

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:12.190
No, she's giving birth to a child.

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:14.110
Giving birth?

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:16.270
It means...

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:18.990
Why are you here anyways?

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:21.320
I was brought here.

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:23.490
Ugh, you get on my nerves.

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:28.580
It means to push the baby that's inside
outside the body.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:36.460
You mean, humans create humans
inside their bodies?

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:38.260
That is incredible.

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:40.760
You didn't even know that?

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:47.810
Okay, breathe out slowly now.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:50.810
One, two...

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:56.570
Oh no...

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:57.860
A breech position.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:01.070
-Breech?
-The baby's upside down.

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:04.410
But don't worry. I can do this.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:12.410
-No arms.
-What?

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:17.290
No, calm down.
They're just still inside the body.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.090
Pull it out slowly...

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:24.300
-There!
-Let me.

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:25.510
Almost, now.

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:33.890
She's not crying.

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:38.610
Babies cry to send air into their lungs.

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:42.070
It's a bad sign if they don't cry.

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:05.380
And that was how she was born.

00:22:06.680 --> 00:22:09.470
Éléonore, the only child.

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:31.830
Avoiding the crowds, I walk in the dark

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:36.830
And wait with bated breath in the wings

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:41.460
My expression is calm
while I scream inside

00:22:41.630 --> 00:22:46.420
On the verge of being torn apart

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:51.220
I dance and beckon you to join me

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:56.020
As a shadow swings across the stage

00:22:56.180 --> 00:22:59.100
I tell myself this is the last time

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:05.110
But I can't seem to cut myself free

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:09.740
Too scared to stop for a moment

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:15.250
My impatience hides
the cries of somebody left behind

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:23.500
Nobody notices the shadow
standing in the sudden rain

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:31.590
Somewhere far away,
a memory of you is saying goodbye

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:38.890
I stand here watching,
no longer able to reach you
